 - `npm run dev` starts Vite at `http://127.0.0.1:5173/Tahion_Personal_site/`.
 - `npm run preview` serves the production build at `http://127.0.0.1:4173/Tahion_Personal_site/`.
-- `npm run check` runs ESLint, Prettier check, TypeScript, and production build.
+- `npm test` runs the built-in Node test runner for visual preference persistence and synchronization.
+- `npm run check` runs ESLint, Prettier check, tests, TypeScript, and production build.
+
+## Visual Preferences
+
+The backdrop variant and color theme are stored together as version `1` JSON under
+`tahion.visual.preferences`. On first load, the site reads the legacy
+`tahion.backdrop.variant` and `tahion.backdrop.theme` strings independently and migrates
+any valid choices without changing or removing those old keys. Missing data uses the
+`signal` and `acid` defaults without a startup write; malformed or unsupported current
+records also use both defaults without overwriting the record. Valid changes are saved as
+one record, and valid changes or removal from another same-origin tab synchronize the
+controls and backdrop without writing back in response.
 
